        "original_id": "e8d10b6b-0ab2-5468-9027-6cb522ace6c9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- TV Series: Death in Paradise, Father Ted, My Hero\n- People: Robert Thorogood, Ben Miller, Kris Marshall, Ardal O'Hanlon, Sara Martins\n- Roles: DI Jack Mooney, Father Dougal McGuire, George Sunday, Thermoman, Detective Sergeant Camille Bordey\n- Places: Guadeloupe\n- Topics: British-French crime comedy-drama television\n\nFacts:\n- Robert Thorogood created Death in Paradise as a British-French crime comedy-drama television series.\n- Ben Miller starred in Death in Paradise for series 1 through 3.\n- Kris Marshall starred in Death in Paradise for series 3 through 6.\n- Ardal O'Hanlon starred in Death in Paradise from series 6 onward.\n- Ardal O'Hanlon played Father Dougal McGuire in Father Ted.\n- Ardal O'Hanlon played George Sunday, also known as Thermoman, in My Hero.\n- Ardal O'Hanlon played DI Jack Mooney in Death in Paradise.\n- Sara Martins appeared as Detective Sergeant Camille Bordey in Death in Paradise.\n- Death in Paradise was filmed in Guadeloupe, a French overseas department.",
